<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28842" root="عرم" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرْمَى وَٱللّٰهِ</span></b>  is a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمَا وَٱللّٰهِ</span>, (IAar, K,
TA,) as also [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرْمَى واللّٰه</span>, and] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرْمَى وَٱللّٰهِ</span>: one
says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرْمَى وَٱللّٰهِ لَأَفْعَلَنٌ كَذَا</span> [<i>Verily,</i> or <i>now
surely, by God, I will indeed do such a thing</i>].
(IAar, TA.)

